    "question": {
      ":question/id": "3f43249e-5ef3-580b-a515-c72a75941f4c",
      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\cos\\left(\\frac{225}{2}^{\\circ}\\right)}{\\csc\\left(\\frac{225}{2}^{\\circ}\\right)}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\cos\\left(\\frac{225}{2}^{\\circ}\\right)}{\\csc\\left(\\frac{225}{2}^{\\circ}\\right)}=\n$$\n{{value}}",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Rewrite the reciprocal denominator to expose a sine\u2013cosine product.\n\nSet $x=\\frac{225}{2}^{\\circ}$.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\cos\\left(x\\right)}{\\csc\\left(x\\right)}=\\cos\\left(x\\right)\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\csc\\left(x\\right)}=\\sin x\\cos x\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\sin x\\cos x &=\\sin(2x) \\\\ &=\\sin\\left(225^{\\circ}\\right) \\\\ &=- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute this exact value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\cos\\left(\\frac{225}{2}^{\\circ}\\right)}{\\csc\\left(\\frac{225}{2}^{\\circ}\\right)}&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right) \\\\ &=- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
